purpose:
Isolated, repeatable review builds for the original rigged-parts adapter.

This adapter never emits an approved release. Failed builds retain their logs;
current.json changes only after all required mechanical checks pass.

Image-derived temporal diagnostics plus explicit source/semantic review gates.

No metric is a naturalness score. Optical-flow warping is measurement-only;
original RGBA masters are never aligned, repaired, relabeled or rewritten.

Fresh original modular mesh, actual source-transform walk bake and CPU render.

Author animation transforms are CC0. All visible geometry is constructed here;
no source mannequin mesh or rejected project art is used. No generated-art claim.
